From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: UnlimitedBytes <admin@unlimitedbytes.ovh>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 2026 20:14:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add multithreaded chunk and entity ticking infrastructure

- Add entity ticking support to LevelChunkRegion with IteratorSafeOrderedReferenceSet
- Add task scheduling support to LevelChunkRegion with DelayedTask
- Add entity tracking methods to LevelChunkRegionMap
- Create ConfettiChunkTicker for multithreaded chunk ticking
- Create ConfettiEntityTicker for multithreaded entity ticking
- Create Confetti utility class with runSync/ensureSync APIs
- Hook tickingRegions into moonrise ChunkSystem
- Add tickingRegions field to ServerLevel
- Add previousTickingChunkPosRegion field to Entity

